<title>USA: Fountain Fresh says sells licensing rights.</title>
<headline>Fountain Fresh says sells licensing rights.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fountain Fresh International said Monday BeSt Way USA Inc will pay a $5 million licensing fee for its proprietary beverage equipment and syrups, and will pay an ongoing royalty fee based upon the volume of domestic sales.</p>
<p>The company also said BeSt Way will purchase its United States units, and will assume full operational support and management of them. The company declined to disclose the purchase price of that deal.</p>
